			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <br>I still/again use rss2email - implicit read/keep sync across all (imap) mail clients. Especially if you use mailserver-side filters/sorters (sieve) to sort all news into a subfolder.</p><p>Btw that’s the software Aaron Swartz originally programmed - and still is the fastest/easiest in daily reading for me.</p>",
