			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Google Reader was simultaneously a boon and a bane. Boon: You were no longer limited to reading your feed on the one computer that your reader software was installed on. Bane: Fuck you if one of the RSS feeds you followed didn't observer the insane restrictions that Google Reader arbitrarily and absurdly imposed on all RSS feeds, in direct violation of the RSS standard!</p>",
